   "source": [
    "# 🎨 text-to-emoji Training Notebook\n",
    "\n",
    "## Text-to-Pixel Art Generator using Diffusion Transformer (DiT)\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook contains the complete text-to-emoji training pipeline with all source code embedded.\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "**Setup Instructions:**\n",
    "1. Runtime → Change runtime type → **GPU (T4 or better)**\n",
    "2. Run cells in order from top to bottom\n",
    "3. Configure parameters in Section 2\n",
    "4. Run Section 3 for training\n",
    "5. Run Section 4 for inference"
   ]
  },
